\newlabel{tab:homology-ablation}{{8}{19}{Homology-dimension ablation (C3), $n=5$ seeds per arm, both design distributions, native encoder path at the shared $q=0.95$ calibration (Section~\ref {ssec:calibration}) rather than each vectorization's own appendix-preferred default. PI and BC are complete; LS's $H_1$-only arm has not been run (\#\#\# = not yet run) -- LS's $H_0{+}H_1$ default is the native row of Table~\ref {tab:main-comparison} ($0.132\pm 0.008$ T / $0.250\pm 0.005$ NT, 3 seeds), not repeated here since it was not re-run at $n=5$}{table.caption.15}{}}
